          "Build dynamic course and lesson authoring APIs with markdown parsing and video lesson embedding",
          "Implement a granular progress tracking engine recording chapter completion, quiz scores, and overall %",
          "Build an interactive quiz runner evaluating student answers server-side with instant feedback",
