        "summary": "Build an irresistible personal brand that passes automated ATS screeners and attracts inbound recruiters. Master the Google X-Y-Z bullet format, optimize LinkedIn profile keywords, and publish a clean portfolio website.",
        "content": "### Learning Objectives\nBy the end of this module, you will be able to:\n1. Understand how **Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS)** parse, rank, and filter incoming resumes before a human recruiter ever sees them.\n2. Structure bullet points using the **Google X-Y-Z Formula**: *\"Accomplished [X], as measured by [Y], by doing [Z]\"*.\n3. Optimize your LinkedIn headline, summary, skills section, and featured portfolio links for recruiter search queries.\n4. Avoid common resume mistakes: multi-column formatting bugs, missing metrics, and generic tool lists.\n5. Create a clean, responsive personal portfolio website showcasing your best case studies.\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Google X-Y-Z Bullet Point Formula\n\nWeak bullet points list duties. Strong bullet points prove quantifiable business impact:\n\n```\n❌ WEAK (Duty-based):\n\"Responsible for writing SQL queries and building Power BI dashboards for the sales team.\"\n\n✅ STRONG (Google X-Y-Z Impact Formula):\n\"Automated daily sales & inventory reporting across 5 regional branches by engineering a PostgreSQL & Power BI pipeline, reducing reporting lag from 4 days to real-time and saving 12 analyst hours weekly.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. ATS Resume Checklist\n- **Single-Column Layout**: Multi-column and graphic-heavy resumes confuse ATS parsers.\n- **Standard Section Headers**: `Work Experience`, `Projects`, `Technical Skills`, `Education`, `Certifications`.\n- **Keyword Alignment**: Include exact keywords from target job descriptions (`Power BI`, `DAX`, `PostgreSQL`, `pandas`, `Data Cleaning`, `ETL`).\n- **Quantifiable Metrics**: Include percentages, financial sums (KSh or USD), and time savings in every bullet.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Summary & Best Practices\n- Save your resume as a standard PDF named `FirstName_LastName_Data_Analyst_CV.pdf`.\n- Feature your live Power BI portfolio link and GitHub profile prominently in your contact header.",
