            "subtitle": "Unique acoustic traits: Whistling, Echoing Bounces, Soft Glide, and Sound Deviation",
            "readingTime": "5 min",
            "arabic": "الصَّفِيرُ • الْقَلْقَلَةُ • اللِّينُ • الِانْحِرَافُ",
