        "content": "\n# Module 7: Revision, Step-by-Step Self-Assessment & Prayer Checklist\n\nCongratulations on reaching the final capstone module of **Salah From Zero: Prayer & Its Meaning**!\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Our 7-Module Curriculum\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     FAHMRISE SALAH CURRICULUM OVERVIEW                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Module 1: Significance & Spiritual Foundations (2nd Pillar, Mi'raj)     │\n│ Module 2: Taharah & Wudu (Physical & Ritual Purification, Sunnah Steps) │\n│ Module 3: Conditions & Pillars (9 Shuroot, 14 Arkan, Madhahib Respect) │\n│ Module 4: Practical Salah (Postures, 2/3/4 Rak'ah flows, Madhhabs)     │\n│ Module 5: Recitations & Khushu' (Du'a al-Istiftah, Tashahhud, Durood)   │\n│ Module 6: Mistakes & Sujood as-Sahw (Rectifying errors, Jumu'ah, Qasr)  │\n│ Module 7: Comprehensive Self-Audit & Lifelong Prayer Blueprint          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. The Comprehensive Daily Prayer Self-Audit Checklist\n\nBefore every prayer, run through this 5-point quality checklist to safeguard both the validity and spiritual presence of your worship:\n\n### 1. Purity & Environmental Check (*Taharah*)\n- [ ] Is my Wudu valid? (No nullifiers like bathroom use, gas, or unconscious sleep).\n- [ ] Are my body, clothing, and prayer rug completely clean from physical impurities (*Najasah*)?\n- [ ] Is my Awrah fully covered according to Islamic guidelines?\n\n### 2. Time & Direction Check (*Waqt & Qiblah*)\n- [ ] Has the prescribed prayer time entered?\n- [ ] Am I directly facing the Qiblah (the Ka'bah in Makkah)?\n\n### 3. Sincerity & Intention Check (*Ikhlas & Niyyah*)\n- [ ] Have I dedicated this prayer solely to Allah, free from showing off (*Riya'*)?\n- [ ] Do I have the clear internal resolve in my heart for this specific prayer (Fajr, Dhuhr, Asr, Maghrib, or Isha)?\n\n### 4. Physical Stillness Check (*Tuma'neenah*)\n- [ ] Am I pausing long enough in Ruku' and Sujood for all joints and bones to settle at rest?\n- [ ] Are my seven contact limbs firmly placed on the ground during Sujood (forehead/nose, palms, knees, toes)?\n- [ ] Are my forearms elevated off the ground (avoiding the dog-like posture)?\n- [ ] If praying in congregation, am I following the Imam without preceding him?\n\n### 5. Heart Presence & Contemplation Check (*Khushu'*)\n- [ ] Am I reflecting on the meaning of Surah Al-Fatihah as a direct conversation with Allah?\n- [ ] Am I contemplating the testimony of faith in the Tashahhud and the blessings of Salawat Ibrahimiyyah?\n- [ ] Have I eliminated worldly distractions (silenced my phone, cleared my immediate view)?\n\nMay Allah make you and your family among those who establish regular, sound, and accepted prayer (*Muqeem as-Salah*), and grant you the ultimate peace in this life and the Hereafter!\n      ",
