        "content": "# Chapter 2: Essential French Vocabulary & Numbers\n\nA strong vocabulary base gives you the tools to name and describe the world in French.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Numbers 1 to 20 & The Tens\n\n- **1–10:** un, deux, trois, quatre, cinq, six, sept, huit, neuf, dix.\n- **11–20:** onze, douze, treize, quatorze, quinze, seize, dix-sept, dix-huit, dix-neuf, vingt.\n- **Tens:** trente (30), quarante (40), cinquante (50), soixante (60), soixante-dix (70), quatre-vingts (80), quatre-vingt-dix (90), cent (100).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Calendar & Time Expressions\n- **Days:** lundi, mardi, mercredi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi, dimanche.\n- **Seasons:** le printemps (spring), l'été (summer), l'automne (autumn), l'hiver (winter).",
